# Build is Go-only (see Dockerfile). Nothing below is needed in the
# image, and pulling them in either bloats the build context (Flutter)
# or risks baking dev secrets into the image (secrets/, .env).

# Flutter — 1.3GB+ including .dart_tool/ and build/ once pub get/run has
# been executed. None of it is referenced by the Go build stage.
flutter/

# Local Go binaries left over from `go build .` at the repo root.
/auth
/matchmaking
/notification
/payment
/quiz
/scoring

# Test scaffolding and local-only outputs.
test/
*.test
*.exe
coverage.out

# Docs / spec — only consumed by humans.
docs/
*.md
*.pdf
README*
CLAUDE*
production-readiness*
2026-*.md
problem-*.md

# VCS + tooling state.
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
.dart_tool/
.claude/

# Runtime config — env files belong on the host, never in the image.
.env
.env.*
secrets/

# OS noise.
.DS_Store
